    slug: "pos-system-buying-guide-2025",
    title: "POS System Buying Guide: What to Look for in 2025",
    excerpt: "Choosing the right POS system impacts every part of your business. This guide covers hardware, software, integrations, and pricing to help you make the best decision.",
    category: "Technology",
